# [[ .PkgFullName ]] - Type-safe API SDK

**English** | [简体中文](./README.md)

> `[[ .PkgFullName ]]` is a TypeScript API client generated by [openapi-generator-ts-cli](https://github.com/[[ .OrgName ]]/openapi-generator-ts-cli) from a **remote OpenAPI/Swagger document**. The contract is the single source of truth: regenerate and your types, methods and doc comments follow the server. The hand-written layer owns timeout, retry, auth and error semantics. It ships ESM / CJS / `.d.ts` in one build and is ready to `npm publish` for other teams.

